flowchart TD
  A[Method A calls B] --> B[Method B calls C]
  B --> C[Method C throws ArgumentException]
  C --> D{Catch in C?}
  D -->|no| E{Catch in B?}
  E -->|yes| F[Handler runs in B]
  E -->|no| G{Catch in A?}
  G -->|no| H[Unhandled — thread ends]

